# -------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Staff Auth â€” public
# -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 Registration status â€” public â€” GET /api/staff/status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/status

### 1.2 Register â€” public â€” POST /api/staff/apply â€” multipart profile_pic
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/apply
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundaryStaff

------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="email"

staff.nurse@example.com
------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="password"

Staff@123
------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="phone_number"

01730000001
------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="gender"

Female
------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profile_pic"; filename="staff.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./server/uploads/staff/staff.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundaryStaff--

### 1.3 Login â€” public â€” POST /api/staff/login â€” â­ RETURNS TOKEN
# @name staffLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "staff.nurse@example.com",
  "password": "Staff@123"
}

