### 3.4 Assign hospital + schedule to appointment â€” ðŸ”’ staff â€” PATCH /api/staff/appointments/:id/schedule
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/schedule
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "hospital_id": 1,
  "schedule_id": 1
}

### 3.5 Approve appointment â€” ðŸ”’ staff â€” PATCH /api/staff/appointments/:id/approve â€” pendingâ†’scheduled
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/appointments/1/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

### 3.6 Reject appointment â€” ðŸ”’ staff â€” PATCH /api/staff/appointments/:id/reject
