Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{staffToken}}

{
  "against_type": "doctor",
  "against_id": 1,
  "complaint_type": "Unprofessional conduct",
  "description": "Doctor was late for scheduled consultation without notice."
}

### 4.4 Complaint history â€” ðŸ”’ staff â€” GET /api/staff/complaints
