# =============================================================================
# 8. Frontend Auth (no API — JWT reuse) — manual verify
# =============================================================================
# Auto logout 5m: client/src/hooks/useInactivityLogout.js in StaffDashboard.jsx:51.
# Already logged in: visit /staff-login while any token ? block.
# Protected: /staff-dashboard without token ? redirect to /staff-login.

### 8.1 Smoke 401 without token ? 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/profile
# No Authorization — expect 401

### 8.2 Bad token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/staff/profile
Authorization: Bearer bad.token.here

